{"id":"db96d7ccaab1ce99","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-lowenheimreproductive.md","title":"Löwenheim reproductive parametrization","display":"thm-lowenheimreproductive — Löwenheim reproductive parametrization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-lowenheimreproductive","aliases":["27-thm-lowenheimreproductive"],"display":"thm-lowenheimreproductive — Löwenheim reproductive parametrization","depends_on":["[[27-df-solution]]","[[27-df-boolop]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§2.11.3 Theorem 2.23 and proof","source_printed_pages":"114","source_pdf_pages":"138","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-lowenheimreproductive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-lowenheimreproductive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lowenheimreproductive — Löwenheim reproductive parametrization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed235bccfeff0bde\" href=\"?note=ed235bccfeff0bde\" title=\"27-df-solution\">27-df-solution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.11.3 Theorem 2.23 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"114"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"138"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathrm{Sol}(f)\">\\(a\\in\\mathrm{Sol}(f)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sol}(f)=\\{x\\mid f(x)=0\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sol}(f)=\\{x\\mid f(x)=0\\}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed235bccfeff0bde\" href=\"?note=ed235bccfeff0bde\" title=\"27-df-solution\">27-df-solution</a>；标量运算见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_a:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^n,\\qquad(\\sigma_a(p))_i\\coloneqq(a_i\\wedge f(p))\\vee(p_i\\wedge(1-f(p)))\\quad(i\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma_a:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^n,\\qquad(\\sigma_a(p))_i\\coloneqq(a_i\\wedge f(p))\\vee(p_i\\wedge(1-f(p)))\\quad(i\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall p\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(\\sigma_a(p))=0),\\qquad\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Sol}(f)\\;(\\sigma_a(p)=p),\\qquad\\operatorname{ran}(\\sigma_a)=\\mathrm{Sol}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall p\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(\\sigma_a(p))=0),\\qquad\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Sol}(f)\\;(\\sigma_a(p)=p),\\qquad\\operatorname{ran}(\\sigma_a)=\\mathrm{Sol}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 Löwenheim 的 reproductive 参数化：当 f(p)=1 时送到已知解 a，当 f(p)=0 时固定 p。两种情形同时证明输出是解、每个解被固定及满射。旧条目只有有限集合可被满射覆盖的泛泛存在性，未表达书中机制；本次将错误归属的旧文件标识 lowmuller 改为 lowenheimreproductive，并同步本目录引用。原书 Theorem 2.23 的坐标函数应取值于 B，本笔记明确使用向量 σ。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-solution","status":"resolved","id":"ed235bccfeff0bde","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-solution]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolop]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-solution","status":"resolved","id":"ed235bccfeff0bde","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$a\\in\\mathrm{Sol}(f)$，其中 $\\mathrm{Sol}(f)=\\{x\\mid f(x)=0\\}$ 见 [[27-df-solution]]；标量运算见 [[27-df-boolop]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$a\\in\\mathrm{Sol}(f)$，其中 $\\mathrm{Sol}(f)=\\{x\\mid f(x)=0\\}$ 见 [[27-df-solution]]；标量运算见 [[27-df-boolop]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathrm{Sol}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sol}(f)=\\{x\\mid f(x)=0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_a:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^n,\\qquad(\\sigma_a(p))_i\\coloneqq(a_i\\wedge f(p))\\vee(p_i\\wedge(1-f(p)))\\quad(i\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall p\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(\\sigma_a(p))=0),\\qquad\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Sol}(f)\\;(\\sigma_a(p)=p),\\qquad\\operatorname{ran}(\\sigma_a)=\\mathrm{Sol}(f).","display":true}],"bytes":1717,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-455","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-lowenheimreproductive|thm-lowenheimreproductive — Löwenheim reproductive parametrization]]"}],"outgoing":["ed235bccfeff0bde","11de8465f2282555"]}